                <invention-title lang="en">HEARING AID CONNECTOR</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A hearing aid comprising a hearing aid housing 1 with a connector socket 2 and an earpiece connector 3 with a connector plug 4, and where the connector socket 2 and the connector plug 4 are configured such that the connector plug 4 is releasably attached in the connector socket 2 for connecting the connector 3 to the hearing aid housing 1. The connector plug 4 comprises a connector plug body 5 having a separate deadbolt 6 movably arranged in the connector plug body 5.</p>
            </abstract>
